    },
    {
      "text": "Suppose a congestion-control scheme results in a collection of competing flows that achieve\nthe following throughput rates:\n",
      "page": 6,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        93.03,
        528.99,
        124.41
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "200 KBps, 3 MBps, 400 KBps, 1 MBps, 8 MBps\n",
      "page": 6,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        129.27,
        308.04,
        146.49
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Calculate the fairness index for this scheme. Show your work, otherwise, you will get zero\ncredit.\n",
      "page": 6,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        151.47,
        511.63,
        182.85
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Round your answer to two decimal places.\n",
      "page": 6,
      "bbox": [
