    },
    {
      "text": "5. Suppose a router has three input flows and one output. It receives the packets listed in the\nbelow table all at about the same time, in the order listed, during a period in which the output\nport is busy but all queues are otherwise empty. Give the order in which the packets are\ntransmitted, assuming\n",
      "page": 6,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        387.63,
        528.99,
        447.21
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For parts a and b, show your work. Otherwise, you will get zero credit.\n",
      "page": 6,
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        452.19,
        416.18,
        469.41
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "a.\n(10 points)\nFair queuing.\nb. (10 points)\n",
