    {
      "text": "Flow1_1 = max(0, 0) + 100 = 100\nFlow1_2 = max(100, 0) + 100 = 100 + 100 = 200\nFlow1_3 = max(200, 0) + 100 = 200 + 100 = 300\nFlow1_4 = max(300, 0) + 100 = 300 + 100 = 400\nFlow1_5 = max(400, 0) + 40 = 400 + 40 = 440\n",
